            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure concerns recombinant yeast host cells expressing cell-associated heterologous food and/or feed enzymes which are expressed during the propagation phase of the recombinant yeast host cells. The recombinant yeast host cells can be used in a subsequent production process to make food and/or feed products, for example, baked products.</p>
            </abstract>
